{
  "title": "The Insider Note No. XII | 29 October to 3 November 2026",
  "body_content": "\n\n\n\n\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;mso-hide:all;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;color:#E7E2DA;\">\n  A ridge-to-coast escape, a studio day, and a family Halloween option before Tuesday’s Cup Day.&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;\n</div>\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#E7E2DA;\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;padding:24px 10px 36px 10px;\">\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" class=\"wrap\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;max-width:100%;max-width:600px;background:#0B2E4A;\">\n\n\n  <tr><td height=\"6\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;height:6px;line-height:6px;font-size:6px;background:#F5C177;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n\n  <tr><td class=\"pad\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;padding:28px 18px 0 18px;\">\n    <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n      <td valign=\"top\" class=\"display name\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-family:'Sora','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:36px;line-height:0.94;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.045em;color:#FFFFFF;\">Peninsula<br /><span style=\"color:#7FB2D4;font-weight:300;letter-spacing:-0.035em;\">Insider</span></td>\n      <td class=\"issue-cell\" align=\"right\" valign=\"top\" width=\"60\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:60px;\">\n        <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\"><tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;border:1px solid #6B5A3E;padding:10px 12px 11px 12px;\">\n            <div class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"font-family:'Figtree','Helvetica Neue',Helve