lab\" style=\"font-family:'Figtree','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10px;line-height:1;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;color:#7A9CB6;padding-bottom:8px;\">Sun</div>\n        <div class=\"display spine-num\" style=\"font-family:'Sora','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-weight:600;color:#D7E2EA;\">01</div>\n      </td>\n      <td align=\"center\" width=\"20%\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:20%;padding:15px 0 14px 0;\">\n        <div class=\"eyebrow spine-lab\" style=\"font-family:'Figtree','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10px;line-height:1;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;color:#7A9CB6;padding-bottom:8px;\">Tue</div>\n        <div class=\"display spine-num\" style=\"font-family:'Sora','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-weight:600;color:#D7E2EA;\">03</div>\n      </td>\n    </tr></table>\n  </td></tr>\n\n\n  \n\n\n  <tr><td class=\"inset\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;padding:0 14px;\">\n    <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#F2EFEA;\">\n      <tr><td class=\"pad-sm\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;padding:32px 30px 34px 30px;\">\n        <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n          <tr><td width=\"52\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:52px;\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"52\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td height=\"3\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:52px;height:3px;line-height:3px;font-size:3px;background:#8A5620;\">&nbsp;</td></tr></table></td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-family:'Figtree','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:9px;line-height:1.2;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;letter-spacing:0.18em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A5620;padding:14px 0 14px 0;\">The week ahead</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"display h-stand\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-family:'Sora','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:23px;line-height:1.36;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-weight:500;color:#14202A;letter-spacing:-0.015em;\">October left a longer weekend within reach. The useful decision came first: choose the base, then choose how much to do.</td></tr>\n        </table>\n      </td></tr>\n    </table>\n  </td></tr>\n\n\n  <tr><td class=\"inset\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;padding:26px 14px 0 14px;\">\n    <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n      <td class=\"eyebrow\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;background:#F5C177;padding:8px 14px 7px 14px;font-family:'Figtree','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10px;line-height:1.1;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#14202A;white-space:nowrap;\">The one</td>\n      <td valign=\"middle\" width=\"100%\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;padding-left:14px;\">\n        <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td height=\"1\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;height:1px;line-height:1px;font-size:1px;background:#3E5A72;\">&nbsp;</td></tr></table>\n      </td>\n    </tr></table>\n  </td></tr>\n\n  <tr><td class=\"inset\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;padding:20px 14px 0 14px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">\n    <img src=\"https://www.optiflows.com.au/campaigns/peninsula-insider-october-2026/insider-note/assets/montalto-lead.jpg\" width=\"572\" height=\"362\" alt=\"A patinated metal sculpture of a figure stands on the lawn in front of the Montalto restaurant and its white umbrellas\" class=\"stack-img\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:572px;height:auto;border:0;\" /><div style=\"font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#D7E2EA;padding:8px 0 16px 0;\">Photo &middot; Two Palms Australia, courtesy of Visit Victoria<br />Montalto Vineyard &amp; Olive Grove, Red Hill, Mornington Peninsula.</div>\n  </td></tr>\n\n  <tr><td class=\"pad\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;padding:24px 18px 30px 18px;\">\n    <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n      <tr><td class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-family:'Figtree','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10px;line-height:1.2;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#F5C177;padding-bottom:14px;\">Friday 30 to Sunday 1 &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Red Hill to the coast · STAY</td></tr>\n      <tr><td class=\"display h-lead\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-family:'Sora','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:32px;line-height:1.0;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.04em;color:#FFFFFF;padding-bottom:16px;\">Let the weekend widen</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>\n        <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n          <td width=\"3\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:3px;background:#F5C177;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td>\n          <td style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;padding-left:14px;\">\n            <div class=\"display\" style=\"font-family:'Sora','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:19px;line-height:1.3;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#F5C177;\">Ridge to Sea, two nights</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr></table>\n      </td></tr>\n      <tr><td class=\"body-font\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-family:'Figtree','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.64;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#D7E2EA;padding:18px 0 28px 0;\">Start on the ridge with Montalto, then let the coast shape the next day. The two-night plan puts accommodation and dining decisions first, with park access and weather checked before each walk. Cup Day is Tuesday 3 November; Monday still needs its own leave decision.</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>\n\n\n        <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;background:#F5C177;border-bottom:3px solid #C08F45;white-space:nowrap;\">\n            <a href=\"https://peninsulainsider.com.au/explore/plans/ridge-to-sea-two-night-escape/?utm_source=email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=insider-note-12\" class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;display:block;white-space:normal;padding:17px 20px;font-family:'Figtree','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#14202A;text-decoration:none;\">Open the plan &rarr;</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr></table>\n\n      </td></tr>\n    </table>\n  </td></tr>\n\n\n  <tr><td class=\"inset\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;padding:0 14px;\">\n    <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#F2EFEA;\">\n\n      <tr><td class=\"pad-sm\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;padding:24px 18px 0 18px;\">\n        <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n          <td class=\"eyebrow\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-family:'Figtree','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:9px;line-height:1.2;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;letter-spacing:0.18em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A5620;white-space:nowrap;\">Plan the weekend</td>\n          <td width=\"100%\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;padding-left:14px;\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td height=\"1\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;height:1px;line-height:1px;font-size:1px;background:#D3D5CF;\">&nbsp;</td></tr></table></td>\n        </tr></table>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <tr><td class=\"pad-sm\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;padding:20px 18px 24px 18px;\">\n        <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n\n\n          <td class=\"stack\" width=\"100%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:100%;\">\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n\n              <tr><td style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;padding:16px 0 6px 0;\">\n                <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n                  <td class=\"display num\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-family:'Sora','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:40px;line-height:0.9;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.04em;color:#C9A26B;padding-right:12px;\">30</td>\n                  <td class=\"eyebrow\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-family:'Figtree','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10px;line-height:1.5;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#1D6491;\">Friday<br />Mornington · CULTURE · What’s new</td>\n                </tr></table>\n              </td></tr>\n              <tr><td class=\"display h-card\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-family:'Sora','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:23px;line-height:1.12;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.03em;color:#14202A;padding:8px 0 10px 0;\">See where the work begins</td></tr>\n              <tr><td class=\"body-font\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-family:'Figtree','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.58;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#4B5862;padding-bottom:14px;\">MPRG’s Local artists at work studio tour is listed for Friday 30 October, 9:30am to 3:30pm. Check the gallery’s current booking details before making it your first day.</td></tr>\n              <tr><td><a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com.au/e/local-artists-at-work-a-national-works-on-paper-studio-tour-tickets-2002486956392?utm_source=email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=insider-note-12\" class=\"body-font\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-family:'Figtree','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:700;color:#10527E;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:2px solid #7FB2D4;padding-bottom:2px;\">Check the studio tour &rarr;</a></td></tr>\n            </table>\n          </td></tr><tr><td class=\"stack\" width=\"100%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:100%;\">\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n\n              <tr><td style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;padding:16px 0 6px 0;\">\n                <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n                  <td class=\"display num\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-family:'Sora','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:40px;line-height:0.9;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.04em;color:#C9A26B;padding-right:12px;\">31</td>\n                  <td class=\"eyebrow\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-family:'Figtree','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10px;line-height:1.5;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#1D6491;\">Saturday<br />Moorooduc · EXPLORE · What’s on</td>\n                </tr></table>\n              </td></tr>\n              <tr><td class=\"display h-card\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-family:'Sora','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:23px;line-height:1.12;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.03em;color:#14202A;padding:8px 0 10px 0;\">One farm, a Halloween afternoon</td></tr>\n              <tr><td class=\"body-font\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-family:'Figtree','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.58;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#4B5862;padding-bottom:14px;\">The Big Goose’s Halloweekend is listed for 31 October and 1 November, with Golden Pumpkins and a costume parade. Check the operator’s programme and make this the family day’s anchor.</td></tr>\n              <tr><td><a href=\"https://www.visitmorningtonpeninsula.org/whats-on/view/18175/halloweekend-at-the-big-goose?utm_source=email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=insider-note-12\" class=\"body-font\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-family:'Figtree','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:700;color:#10527E;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:2px solid #7FB2D4;padding-bottom:2px;\">Check the family programme &rarr;</a></td></tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n\n        </tr></table>\n      </td></tr>\n\n    </table>\n  </td></tr>\n\n\n  <tr><td class=\"inset\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;padding:26px 14px 0 14px;\">\n    <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#FFFFFF;\">\n      <tr><td height=\"4\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;height:4px;line-height:4px;font-size:4px;background:#8A5620;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n      <tr><td class=\"pad-sm\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;padding:24px 18px 18px 18px;\">\n        <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n          <tr><td class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-family:'Figtree','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:9px;line-height:1.2;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;letter-spacing:0.18em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:#8A5620;padding-bottom:14px;\">The editorial &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; From the Journal</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"display h-sec\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-family:'Sora','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:32px;line-height:1.06;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.04em;color:#14202A;\">Sorrento beyond the summer strip</td></tr>\n        </table>\n      </td></tr>\n      <tr><td style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">\n        <img src=\"https://www.optiflows.com.au/campaigns/peninsula-insider-october-2026/insider-note/assets/sorrento-editorial.jpg\" width=\"572\" height=\"318\" alt=\"Clifftop lawn and weatherboard houses above a bay dotted with moored boats and jetties along Millionaire&#x27;s Walk\" class=\"stack-img\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:572px;height:auto;border:0;\" /><div style=\"font-family:Figtree,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#3A4750;padding:8px 0 16px 0;\">Photo &middot; Courtesy of Visit Victoria<br />Sorrento, Mornington Peninsula.</div>\n      </td></tr>\n      <tr><td class=\"pad-sm\" style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;padding:20px 18px 24px 18px;\">\n        <p class=\"body-font\" style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-family:'Figtree','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.65;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#3A4750;\">Sorrento works as a base when you give the village some time. Our weekend story is the companion to a slower stay, with the bay and back beach shaping the day rather than another trip up the ridge.</p>\n        <a href=\"https://peninsulainsider.com.au/journal/th